  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a large pan over medium-high heat.",
    "Add curry paste and cook, stirring constantly, for 1-2 minutes.",
    "Add tofu and cook until golden brown on all sides, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add coconut milk, fish sauce (if using), and brown sugar. Bring to a simmer.",
    "Reduce heat to medium-low and cook, stirring occasionally, until the sauce has thickened and the tofu is coated, about 10-15 minutes.",
    "Stir in butter until melted.",
    "Season with salt to taste.",
    "Garnish with Thai basil and serve with lime wedges on the side."
